	(text "Integrated synchronous bucks: U20 V3V3/2.2uH, U21 V5/3.3uH. TI TPS56637 Table4 and EVM-029 starting network.\nBUCK_EN requires closed RUN AND eFuse PG; TLV7031 POR output LOW. U60 independently supervises rails/reset.\nR24/R29 are quiet AGND ground-star straps; do not carry switched-current returns through them. Effective output C must remain20..100uF.\nPlaced-package engineering proposal. No full copper routing, fabrication release or prototype/PVT/thermal qualification."
		(at 285.75 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)))
		(uuid 36729dad-0742-5946-8ebd-66301d632e8b))
